  <p id="c-hanshu-006-wudi:p001" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-hanshu-006-wudi:m001-0000" ref="yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAA">孝武皇帝</persName>，<persName id="c-hanshu-006-wudi:m001-0005" ref="yqp_nlb_p1p_ACA">景帝</persName>中子也，母曰<persName id="c-hanshu-006-wudi:m001-0013" ref="6d6_eg1_o3a_A">王美人</persName>。年四歲立為膠東王。七歲為皇太子，母為皇后。十六歲，後三年正月，<persName id="c-hanshu-006-wudi:m001-0048" ref="yqp_nlb_p1p_ACA">景帝</persName>崩。甲子，<persName id="c-hanshu-006-wudi:m001-0055" ref="yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAA">太子</persName>即皇帝位，尊<persName id="c-hanshu-006-wudi:m001-0063" ref="ixk_6fg_v6f_A">皇太后竇氏</persName>曰太皇太后，<persName id="c-hanshu-006-wudi:m001-0074" ref="6d6_eg1_o3a_A">皇后</persName>曰皇太后。三月，封<persName id="c-hanshu-006-wudi:m001-0085" ref="6d6_eg1_o3a_A">皇太后</persName>同母弟<persName id="c-hanshu-006-wudi:m001-0091" ref="7mz_d13_9ka_A">田蚡</persName>、<persName id="c-hanshu-006-wudi:m001-0094" ref="7mz_d13_9ka_B">勝</persName>皆為列侯。</p>
  <p id="c-hanshu-006-wudi:p024" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter">六年春二月乙未，遼東高廟災。夏四月壬子，高園便殿火。<persName id="c-hanshu-006-wudi:m024-0026" ref="yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAA">上</persName>素服五日。</p>
  <p id="c-hanshu-006-wudi:p025" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter">五月丁亥，<persName id="c-hanshu-006-wudi:m025-0005" ref="ixk_6fg_v6f_A">太皇太后</persName>崩。</p>
  <p id="c-hanshu-006-wudi:p028" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter">元光元年冬十一月，初令郡國舉孝廉各一人。</p>
  <p id="c-hanshu-006-wudi:p039" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter">四年冬，<persName id="c-hanshu-006-wudi:m039-0004" ref="nuf_tb9_fjs_A">魏其侯竇嬰</persName>有罪，棄巿。</p>
  <p id="c-hanshu-006-wudi:p040" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter">春三月乙卯，<persName id="c-hanshu-006-wudi:m040-0006" ref="7mz_d13_9ka_A">丞相蚡</persName>薨。</p>
  <p id="c-hanshu-006-wudi:p133" annotation-status="named_mentions_first_pass" text-layer="received_chapter">遣伏波將軍<persName id="c-hanshu-006-wudi:m133-0005" ref="vib_10x_51n">路博德</persName>出桂陽，下湟水；樓船將軍<persName id="c-hanshu-006-wudi:m133-0020" ref="jk8_8gt_vmi">楊僕</persName>出豫章，下湞水；歸義越侯<persName id="c-hanshu-006-wudi:m133-0034" ref="4zn_n9v_k0v">嚴</persName>為戈船將軍，出零陵，下離水；<persName id="c-hanshu-006-wudi:m133-0049" ref="iw9_udd_jr2">甲</persName>為下瀨將軍，下蒼梧。皆將罪人，江淮以南樓船十萬人。越馳義侯<persName id="c-hanshu-006-wudi:m133-0079" ref="dzl_mvt_l93">遺</persName>別將巴蜀罪人，發夜郎兵，下牂柯江，咸會番禺。</p>
</text>
